# Tracer: missing-delimiter diagnostics preserve original source positions.
#
# Before (rejected):
# have a R = (1 + 2
# Former diagnostic: parse_error: unexpected end of tokens at line 1 in <eval>
# Current diagnostic for that same rejected input:
# Parse error: expected `)`, reached end of line
#  --> <eval>:1:18
#   |
# 1 | have a R = (1 + 2
#   |                  ^ missing `)`
#
# Now: adding the missing delimiter verifies the intended value.
have a R = (1 + 2)
a = 3
